<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>And then I'm brought back to the real world.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It feels like I was immersed in the world of foresight for a long time, but <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE> and I are still looking into each other's eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the real world, probably not even a second has passed.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> okay? You've looked unwell for a while now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ah, yes... I'm fine..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if I'd just remembered it, I put the rest of the completely cold peperoncino in my mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the end, I never could taste it, right to the last.<PG>
If things go on like this, sooner or later <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> and the others will head to the Arata settlement, arrest <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Mommy</STYLE>, and come face to face with <STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE> and the others will see there is an ending far too merciless―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE> won't forgive the ones who pushed for <STYLE ID="7">Auntie's</STYLE> arrest, not <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE> and not <STYLE ID="8">Kogori-san</STYLE>.<PG>
I didn't see the world of foresight through to the end, but after that, <STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE> will probably be arrested, and <STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE> subdued too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Up against that many people, there's no way even <STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, made strong by the mountain seclusion, could handle them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If things go badly, <STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE> will end up caught by the police too.<PG>
I have to stop <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> and the others from reaching the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It won't end with just <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Mommy</STYLE> being arrested.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An ending like this―not one person gets to be happy...!<PG>
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
In that case.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to take steps to avoid this wretched ending.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The only one who knows what ending is coming is me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no one I can trust outside the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE>, if he learns that <STYLE ID="7">Auntie</STYLE> is in the Arata settlement, will surely go there eventually, however much he tries to smooth things over just for now.<PG>
From here on I have to think of a way to persuade <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE>, or <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As long as <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> is in the position of a police officer, persuading him is out of the question.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE> has that strong sense of justice and that fixation on <STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, and on top of that a mind I can't come close to.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I try to persuade her, I might end up being talked around by <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE> instead...<PG>
What I can do to protect <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Mommy</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If persuasion is impossible, is force the only way?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I say force, but even if I could beat the two of them to a pulp, I couldn't make them do what I say.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, if anything, I'd get picked up by the police and the situation would get worse.<PG>
Come to think of it―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\血しぶき背景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ナイフ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ナイフ横.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
there were two knives in my bag.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe I should throw away a naive idea like beating them to a pulp, here and now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, what am I thinking...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's not what I came here to do!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Think of another way...!<PG>
Then what way is there?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
You've thought of a sure method, and you're not going to use it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm telling you, I must never, ever do that!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I mustn't even think about force...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I... what am I thinking...?<PG>
Calm down. If my way is wrong, my precognition should tell me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So... 
{PAUSE ""}
if that method is dangerous, I just have to stop at the last moment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And if that method turns out to be certain... 
{PAUSE ""}
are you really going to do it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Like I said... 
{PAUSE ""}
it's because I know from the start that the method's dangerous...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So it's to make myself understand that...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Right, what I'm thinking of now is―
{PAUSE ""}
to eliminate <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that method, however certain, is far too risky.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So, to get rid of that option, I'll point a knife at <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If that's dangerous, my intuition will tell me to stop.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's a contradiction, but to not kill <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE>, I'm going to try to kill <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> is a grown police officer. In a scuffle, it's <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE> who has the openings, after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> seems to rely on <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto's</STYLE> reasoning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that gone, even if they reach the Arata settlement eventually, it should hold them back quite a lot.<PG>
If I attack with a knife, I can probably eliminate her leaving almost no evidence.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've hunted hundreds of beasts until now, so I know at least what I need to be careful about.<PG>
But maybe if I don't make the method sloppy on purpose, I'll be the one who gets suspected instead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For now, I'll make stab wounds all over her body, not deep enough to be fatal, and deliver the finishing blow at a suitable point.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I just have to make it look like a robbery or a <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ごうかん">rape</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, still, I'm sure there'll be nothing to make anyone suspicious.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My precognition should keep that in check for me.<PG>
But then there's no value in trying such a thing in the first place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somewhere in my heart, I'm surely hoping.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That my intuition will hold back my murder, and at the same time urge it on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be that this murderous intent―has something to do with the green eyes?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, surely not.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I just raised the option of getting rid of <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE> to create the best situation through logic.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Green eyes and all that, that's just...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Are </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> going home tomorrow after all?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, I'm going home. I'll give this back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\バース\携帯クリ切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I hold out the smartphone I borrowed to <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course, I've already deleted the call history.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> should hold on to this until tomorrow. I'm planning to see you off at the station."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He pushes the smartphone I offered back toward me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I won't be using it anymore...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, maybe <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> will contact me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's probably better to do as he says and use this phone.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE\選択開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ予知.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "20" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\overdose.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The moment I touch the smartphone, that sensation swallows me, and all five of my senses are cut off from the real world.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This smartphone... 
{PAUSE ""}
has a bug planted in it...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, as long as I carry this smartphone, everything <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> and I say will be overheard...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, it's already too late!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I talked to <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> earlier, I talked about that matter!<PG>
Then... why didn't my intuition kick in at that time?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before I called <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
no, before I took the phone from <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE>, no, even earlier.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I took <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san's</STYLE> personal smartphone, my danger sense should have kicked in!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then does that mean everything I've done so far is safe?<PG>
Right, most of what I talked about with <STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE>, I passed on to <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> didn't try to tell me everything either, and there's no way I could tell <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> everything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means nothing I've said so far is a threat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But holding the smartphone again now is something I can only call extremely dangerous.<PG>
Because if I killed <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE> without knowing about the bug, <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> would hear all of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way he'd let that slide.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I'd be arrested on suspicion of murder, and eventually the Arata settlement too...<PG>
Huh, wait a second!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My intuition isn't holding back the murder of <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE>―it's telling me to kill her without getting caught!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's telling me to kill <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, it can't be...!<PG>
But if I think about it calmly, that method is certainly the sure one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With just the one life of <STYLE ID="1">Erina Goto</STYLE>, the tragic ending can be avoided.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then... 
{PAUSE ""}
Hey, <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> want everyone to be happy too, don't you?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If, with just <STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE> one life, that can be <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="かな">granted</STYLE>...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "20" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'll be heading out soon. As promised, this is my treat."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I take a 2,000-yen bill, a rare sight these days, out of my wallet and put it on the table.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Where are you planning to stay? I've arranged a hotel for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, just in case."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, I planned to sleep outdoors from the start."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sleep outdoors, you say... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Motoki-cho still has a fair amount of nature left, but these days most of it is somebody's land. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">You can't just go into the hills and fields as you please."</STYLE><PG>
Is it all right for me to stay at the hotel <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> says he's arranged?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This smartphone has a bug planted in it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I should assume there's some kind of setup at the hotel too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if there is, my intuition should tell me about that too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"All right. Then I'll be in your care a little longer."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What time do you plan to leave tomorrow?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"On the first train. I want to get home even a little sooner."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Got it. Then I'll gladly accept the treat."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> hands me the 2,000-yen bill I put down, along with the bill for our meal, and walks off toward the Goto sisters.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Probably to say goodbye before we leave.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
For the two of us, I get exactly 1,000 yen in change back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This restaurant seems very reasonable.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"From here to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hotel is just a short walk. Probably easier than going by car."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE> takes my bag out of the car and locks it again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"After I see </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> off, I'll come back here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If anything happens, come here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">um..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Taking the bag from <STYLE ID="2">Ise-san</STYLE>, I falter a little over my words.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Thank you for going to the trouble of getting me a hotel."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's nothing much. Come on, let's go."</STYLE>
